    },
    {
      "id": "326:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:74444:74446"
    },
    {
      "id": "326:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "男人打开了屋门。在黑暗中，他的脚步声朝你冲来。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:74446:74471"
    },
    {
      "id": "326:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你想爬起来，但被一双沉重的大手擒住。你听到他嘟囔着，像唱歌一样呻吟着，就像大象或马匹。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:74471:74516"
    },
    {
      "id": "326:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "他正试着把你拖出小屋。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:74516:74529"
    },
    {
      "id": "326:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要反抗，转到 282。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:74529:74542"
    },
    {
      "id": "326:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要屈服，转到 278。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:74542:74555"
    }
  ]
}
